WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.840
SCP-682 Vs SCP-2337. Could the&nbsp;
Hard to Destroy Reptile meet&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:09.520
its end at the dangerously booming&nbsp;
voice of the talkative Dr. Spanko?

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:14.160
As part of a tissue test, Dr. Spanko&nbsp;
was told 682’s flesh was a tone-deaf&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.560
food critic who needed to be convinced on&nbsp;
what the greatest food in existence was.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:24.800
Spanko argued so loudly that the answer was&nbsp;
gummy worms that it destroyed 682’s flesh.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:28.640
The next step was sending him in&nbsp;
to talk the actual 682 to death,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:32.560
after being told the reptile was&nbsp;
an “anti-gummy worm extremist.”

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:36.080
This seemed promising until Dr. Spanko&nbsp;
confidently entered the chamber,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:41.200
and 682 simply boomed “LEAVE”,&nbsp;
at which point Dr. Spanko turned,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:46.800
literally yelled the wall down, and did&nbsp;
just that. 682 must really hate gummy worms.

